<title>UK: Abbey National sets 250 bln lire Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 250 bln lire Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable step-up bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiano, Cariplo and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *8.00	MATURITY   *01.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.65    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AT PAR ON 01.MAR.02 AFTER WHICH THE DEAL</p>
<p>		PAYS 21 PCT MINUS (TWO TIMES 12-MONTH LIBOR).</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
